<title>FRANCE: Comptoirs Modernes 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Comptoirs Modernes 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>Net attributable before goodwill</p>
<p>				amortization     574	 up 15.5 pct</p>
<p>  Net attrib after goodwill amortization 501	 up 11.2 pct</p>
<p>  Dividend (francs)			     24  vs		22</p>
<p>  Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		   994	 up 19.4 pct</p>
<p>  Turnover				    30,244	 up 11.9 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer Comptoirs Modernes issued its results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said investments totalled 1.7 billion francs in 1996 and would come to two billion this year, with 35 percent earmarked for international development. The dividend will be proposed at the AGM on April 30 and paid out on June 13. (( -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 ))</p>
</text>
